## 3. Taskmaster Usage & Command Reference (Quick Reference)

- **Initialize Project:**
  - `task-master init --rules cursor,windsurf`
- **Parse PRD:**
  - `task-master parse-prd --input='docs/Nutrition_Tracker_PRD.txt'`
- **List Tasks:**
  - `task-master list`
- **Next Task:**
  - `task-master next`
- **Analyze Complexity:**
  - `task-master analyze-complexity --research`
- **Expand Tasks:**
  - `task-master expand --id=<id> --force --research`
- **Update Tasks:**
  - `task-master update --from=<id> --prompt="..."`
- **Set Task Status:**
  - `task-master set-status --id=<id> --status=done`
- **Add Dependency:**
  - `task-master add-dependency --id=<id> --depends-on=<id>`
- **Generate Task Files:**
  - `task-master generate`
- **Use Tags for Features:**
  - `task-master add_tag feature-<name> --description="..."`

